                <head>Agreements between the United States and the Netherlands</head>
                <p>[For text of Agreement, concerning duty-free entry and payment of transportation
                    charges, effected by exchange of notes signed at The Hague January 17, 1949, see
                    Department of State, Treaties and Other International Acts Series (TIAS) No.
                    1881.]</p>
                <p rendition="#center">AGREEMENT AND EXCHANGE OF NOTES BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND
                    THE NETHERLANDS RESPECTING A UNITED STATES EDUCATIONAL FOUNDATION IN THE
                    NETHERLANDS</p>
                <p>[For text of Agreement and exchange of notes, signed at The Hague May 17, 1949,
                    see Department of State, Treaties and Other International Acts Series (TIAS) No.
                    1946.]</p>
            </div>
